<view class="checkin-create"><view class="create-head"><view class="kicker">LEAVE A MARK</view><view class="title">完成这次打卡</view><view class="desc">照片会成为你的旅途档案，也会帮助别人找到值得去的地方。</view></view><view class="form"><view class="field"><text>行程 ID</text><input value="{{tripId}}" disabled placeholder="从行程详情进入会自动带入"/></view><view class="field"><text>地点</text><view class="loc-row"><input maxlength="100" value="{{locationName}}" placeholder="点右侧按钮定位选景点，或手动填写" bindinput="inputLocation"/><view class="loc-btn" bindtap="chooseLocation">定位选景点</view></view><view wx:if="{{locationAddress}}" class="loc-addr">已定位：{{locationAddress}}</view></view><view class="field"><text>照片 {{images.length}}/9</text><view class="image-grid"><view wx:for="{{images}}" wx:key="*this" class="image-item"><image src="{{item}}" mode="aspectFill"/><view class="remove" data-index="{{index}}" bindtap="removeImage">×</view></view><view wx:if="{{images.length < 9}}" class="add" bindtap="chooseImages">＋<text>添加照片</text></view></view></view><view class="field"><text>备注</text><textarea maxlength="500" value="{{note}}" placeholder="写一句当时的心情…" bindinput="inputNote" auto-height="true"/></view><button class="submit" loading="{{sending}}" bindtap="submit">{{sending ? '正在保存' : '保存打卡'}}</button><view wx:if="{{progress}}" class="progress">{{progress}}</view></view></view>

<tuge-overlay />
